","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346798","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"33788","synopsis":"Hanako, Olivia, and Kasumi are asked by Aozora Tsugumi to go into the student council room to retrieve the Banana Papers that are hidden somewhere in there. The Banana Papers contain scandals that have happened around school and the student council president is apparently using that to blackmail other students. Hanako and the other girls try to decline the request, but Tsugumi manages to buy them all off one way or another and they end up having to go get the Banana Papers...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aaQoSxFcTJsMSPrFwUYND59jIlg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Hanako, Olivia, and Kasumi are asked by Aozora Tsugumi to go into the student council room to retrieve the Banana Papers that are hidden somewhere in there. The Banana Papers contain scandals that have happened around school and the student council president is apparently using that to blackmail other students. Hanako and the other girls try to decline the request, but Tsugumi manages to buy them all off one way or another and they end up having to go get the Banana Papers...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aaQoSxFcTJsMSPrFwUYND59jIlg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13750","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101001","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37171","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80539","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346798","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"33792","synopsis":"When Hanako sees Olivia wandering around the classroom with her face glued to her smartphone, she assumes she’s playing t